## DHT22 Pin Map (ESP32)

| DHT22 Pin | ESP32 Pin | Notes                        |
|-----------|-----------|------------------------------|
| VCC       | 3.3V      | Do NOT connect to 5V         |
| DATA      | GPIO4     | Add 10kΩ pull-up to 3.3V    |
| GND       | GND       | Common ground                |

